---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const locale = 'en' as const;
---

<Base
  title="Territory"
  description="Puesco-Lanín and the socioecological corridor of the Andean Araucanía"
  locale={locale}
>
  <div class="section">
    <div class="container container--reading">
      <header class="page-header">
        <h1 class="page-header__title">Territory</h1>
        <p class="page-header__lead">
          The peweñantu as a (co)laboratory: a volcanic corridor where wild boar
          meet forest, community, and conservation policy.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Core case: Puesco-Lanín</h2>
        <p>
          The Puesco sector of Villarrica National Park, on the foothills of Lanín volcano,
          is the headwater of the Trancura sub-basin: volcanic geomorphology, mature native
          forest of high conservation value, and Mapuche-Pewenche spiritual territory.
        </p>
        <p>
          In 2024, communities organized as the <strong>Winkulmapu Indigenous Association</strong>
          signed a Governance Agreement with CONAF and the Ministry of National Assets to manage
          <strong>17,000 hectares</strong> of the Puesco subsection. The agreement grants binding
          executive authority —including invasive species management— and sits at the frontier
          of SBAP and future Indigenous Conservation Areas.
        </p>

        <h2>Secondary cases</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Quiñenahuin</strong> — north, Villarrica National Reserve; mixed native forest,
            regeneration, grasslands, and Mapuche-Pewenche communities.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Panqui</strong> — northwest; native forest and small campesino holdings settled
            around the 1950s.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Palguín Alto</strong> — west, Quetrupillán foothills on the Lanín–Villarrica
            chain; ethnography plus camera-trap density estimates.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
